# Scenario 06: Complex 5x4 Process-Resource Interleaved Mesh
MODE detection
PREVENTION none
VICTIM_POLICY cheapest

RESOURCE CPU 4
RESOURCE RAM 8
RESOURCE SSD 3
RESOURCE NIC 2

PROCESS WebServer 4 50.0
PROCESS AppServer 3 35.0
PROCESS DBCluster 5 80.0
PROCESS LogIndexer 1 5.0
PROCESS Analytics 2 12.0

CLAIM WebServer 2 4 1 1
CLAIM AppServer 1 3 1 1
CLAIM DBCluster 2 4 2 1
CLAIM LogIndexer 1 1 1 0
CLAIM Analytics 2 2 1 1

# Initial allocation
REQUEST WebServer 1 2 0 1
REQUEST AppServer 1 2 1 0
REQUEST DBCluster 2 2 1 0
REQUEST LogIndexer 0 1 1 0
REQUEST Analytics 0 1 0 1

PRINT_STATE
CHECK_SAFETY

# Competing requests causing deadlock
REQUEST WebServer 1 1 1 0
REQUEST AppServer 0 1 0 1
REQUEST DBCluster 0 2 0 1

PRINT_STATE
CHECK_DEADLOCK

RECOVER

PRINT_STATE
